{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e08-scene-04",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "两套方案与本土化草稿  (Two Plans and Xiaogu's Draft)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Kaiwen proposes building two separate proposals so Chun Yuqiao can choose when he returns—and Bu Xiaogu surprises everyone with a localization draft she has been preparing for years. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们仨也不是饭桶，这事必须给扛下来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "做两个方案，已经做好的方案留着备用。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们再做一个真正的改版方案，等淳于总回来让他选。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "真正的改版方案，你有想法吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我从研一就开始研究十二歌王了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "美国原版每一季我都看过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "自从引进中国，因为是淳于师兄制作，我就一直在做本土化的研究。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "十二歌王每一季都有一些微调。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "长期下来，淳于总的改版思路我就明白了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以进了星天之后，我就做了这么一个草稿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "看什么看？可以啊！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们仨也不是饭桶，这事必须给扛下来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The three of us are no slouches; we have to shoulder this ourselves.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "做两个方案，已经做好的方案留着备用。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us make two plans and keep the finished proposal on standby.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们再做一个真正的改版方案，等淳于总回来让他选。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then we build a true overhaul proposal and let Mr Chun Yuqiao choose when he gets back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "真正的改版方案，你有想法吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you have ideas for a true overhaul plan?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我从研一就开始研究十二歌王了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I started studying Twelve Singers back in my first year of graduate school.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "美国原版每一季我都看过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have watched every single season of the original American version.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "自从引进中国，因为是淳于师兄制作，我就一直在做本土化的研究。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ever since it came to China under Senior Chun Yuqiao, I have researched its localization.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "十二歌王每一季都有一些微调。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every season of Twelve Singers has featured subtle adjustments.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "长期下来，淳于总的改版思路我就明白了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Over time, I came to grasp Mr Chun Yuqiao's direction for revamping the show.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "所以进了星天之后，我就做了这么一个草稿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So right after joining Xingtian, I put together this rough draft.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "看什么看？可以啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you staring at? This is impressive!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们仨也不是饭桶，这事必须给扛下来。",
